!bench/results/small_rerankers_shapes_rep.per_query.json
!bench/results/beir_scifact_small_rerankers_shapes_rep.json
!bench/results/beir_scifact_small_rerankers_shapes_rep.per_query.json
!bench/results/beir_fiqa_small_rerankers_shapes_rep.json
!bench/results/beir_fiqa_small_rerankers_shapes_rep.per_query.json
!bench/results/small_rerankers_shapes_frontier.json
!bench/results/small_rerankers_shapes_replicate.json
# M51 Phase 2 (attempt 2): the students retrained at max_length 256, their rows beside the attempt-1 students and
